Package: rpactdash
Title: RPACT Trial Design Workbench
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Abhishek", email = "stat.absk@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A full-capability Shiny dashboard for confirmatory adaptive
    clinical trial design with the 'rpact' package. Every user-facing rpact
    function is exposed through a catalog-driven interface with reproducible
    R code output and an audit trail, targeting regulated (GxP) environments.
